Debug mode highlights an empty class through its name, just like the class after it, whose one-line method `doSomething(): void` is highlighted too.
== args
--debug
input/empty-class.ts
== file input/empty-class.ts
class Empty {
}
class WithMethod {
  doSomething(): void {}
}
== stdout
«class Empty» {
}
«class WithMethod» {
  «doSomething(): void» {}
}
== stderr
== exit 0
